{#- Partnerships (content file 5.14). The layout opens the page (label, h1, lead) and closes it with the
    band above, whose four contact actions stand in the two buttons' place (src/site/_data/actions.json,
    shared with the home page and Contact), and the notice for individuals (4.4). [TBC] brackets are
    stripped and the sentence before each kept; the note under the steps (Part 8 item 36) is for the
    company and does not render. The collaborators are typeset from src/site/_data/collaborators.json:
    no logos without written permission (Part 8 item 25). The page has no photographs: a picture of a
